er-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Pengfei Li", "author_key": "pengfei-li", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Hengjie Si", "author_key": "hengjie-si", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Feiyu Zhu", "author_key": "feiyu-zhu", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Wang Fu", "author_key": "wang-fu", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Likun Wang", "author_key": "likun-wang", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Rui Yao", "author_key": "rui-yao", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Jieru Zhao", "author_key": "jieru-zhao", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Yilun Chen", "author_key": "yilun-chen", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}, {"name": "Wenchao Ding", "author_key": "wenchao-ding", "role": "paper-author", "institutions": []}], "claim": "作者明确指出人类中心数据的运动精度是有限的，其下游收益来自动作分布的多样性而非精度：多样性增强了策略对未见初始状态的泛化能力。", "stance": "conditional", "evidence": {"summary": "5.2 节结果讨论中作者直接陈述：尽管人类中心数据运动精度有限，其多样动作分布增强了对未见初始状态的泛化。", "locator": "5.2 Results and In-depth Discussion", "short_quote": "Although the motion precision in the human-centric data is limited, its diverse action distribution en- hances the policy’s generalization capability to unseen initial states.", "evidence_type": "experiment", "extraction": {"source_format": "html", "method": "html-flat", "quality": "high", "visual_validation": "not-required", "visual_validation_pages": []}}, "confidence": "direct", "core_citations": [], "notes": "数据生态类论文，对手部标注精度有罕见的动捕室定量验收（5mm）与投影相交质检流程；但野外精度未量化、手指级误差未单独报告。与本批次 2605.05945（消费级采集）形成精度-成本对照。", "paper_reading": {"paper_note_schema": 1, "card_id": "2512.24310-C04", "review_mode": "scoping", "reading_status": "evidence-ready", "claim_support_audit": "pass", "topic_ids": ["EA-DATA", "EA-XEMBODIMENT", "EA-SENSOR", "EA-MODEL"], "claim_basis": "author-claim", "relation": "限定综述命题“提高手部检测精度是提升重定向效用的唯一途径”——在分布多样性充足时，有限精度数据仍有正收益，精度与多样性可解耦。", "verification_rationale": "引文为 5.2 节原文；claim 保留了作者“limited precision”的限定，未将其改写为精度无影响。", "quantitative": false}}
